   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forest Initiative (FI)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Skogsinitiativet(SI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1. Skogsinitiativet &#xE4;r ett initiativ med m&#xE5;let att - genom &#xF6;kat svenskt deltagande, - st&#xE4;rka det svenska utvecklingsarbetet f&#xF6;r ett h&#xE5;llbart skogsbruk, s&#xE4;rskilt inom omr&#xE5;den god samh&#xE4;llsstyrning och r&#xE4;ttighetsfr&#xE5;gor. SI &#xE4;r finansierat av Sida och implementerat av F&#xF6;reningen Skogen och Skogsstyrelsen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.The Forest Initiative (FI) is a Sida-supported initiative that aims to, through increased Swedish involvement, strengthen Swedish dev. cooperation to deal with forest resources in a sustainable way. The initiative focus on bottlenecks for sustainable forestry and the fo- rest sector such as good governance,tenure and rights. FI is jointly impl.by the Swedish Forestry Association &amp; the Swedish Forest Agency.</narrative>
  </description>
